---
source: tests/streams.rs
assertion_line: 284
expression: "err(\"fn f(x: Int) -> Int = length(collect(lines)) + x\\n\\nlength([1, 2] | map(f(.)))\")"
---
`lines` cannot be read inside `fn f`; a source is legal only in the program's own body, so take the stream through a `Stream` parameter (at byte 37)
